n there's trouble, we should look out for each other. Lean on others and be leaned on by others.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The owner of \"Paraíso Garage\", a hugely popular club in New Sieg. Cheerful with a good nature, she's an optimist with a penchant for the gaudy. She constantly finds herself in trouble by getting suckered in by suspicious get rich quick schemes. As her cooking skills are lacking, the club's \"Order-in Gourmet\" service is a selling point its patrons can enjoy. She treasures orphaned Alex like family."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c85395"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf56f72d8df20d0e0031d511a828331ed63b917b0f56038439de79fc8bbc61f6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/43/43f9bb2a09816fae12e6c57150d17961941a5cb1dcd597b8436a14fbbe500128.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柿原 徹也","creatorId":"vndb:s80","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s80","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s80","name":"柿原 徹也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:86260","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c85396","characterName":"アレックス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c85396"},"originalCharacterName":"アレックス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"15"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"925"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Please ask me anything about this city. I'm very knowledgeable about it.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A boy who helps out at Carmen's store. As he has no relatives, he lives in an orphanage. Though he's docile and polite, he also has an appropriately childish innocence about him. Knowledgeable in various things about New Sieg, he often helps Teuta by gathering and giving her information about the city."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Full name: Alex Spencer."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c85396"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/38a07f4e323033f38188ead647155b9d24f886c423402ed39930d231c838f95d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f1f300bbc22a0da9a7c1a56f8eda28ff5fcfb39cc180fd23903789f80600145.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西山 宏太朗","creatorId":"vndb:s8864","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8864","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8864","name":"西山 宏太朗","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:86272","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c85397","characterName":"ヴァレリー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c85397"},"originalCharacterName":"ヴァレリー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"34"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"828"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"172"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Tell me... Either my teachings were poor or you're just completely stupid. Which one is it?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Limbo's older sister and the assistant district attorney of New Sieg. A lively person who stirs her surroundings into a tizzy. As a lawyer, she is Limbo's competent superior but according to Limbo, \"she's like a witch\". She always gives off the impression that she's overpowering everyone around her. She gets bored easily and is whimsical."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c85397"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/52c1b8ee5b41e8416f0ae36522916be213301d47e1f917c9afde860e642b0b98.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3b/3bdea50494d1ef33875d383c218c29cc9d87e39076bc1ca1f9e68d2fbdedda50.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"園崎 未恵","creatorId":"vndb:s677","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s677","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s677","name":"園崎未恵(そのざきみえ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:86267","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c85398","characterName":"サウリ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c85398"},"originalCharacterName":"サウリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"42"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"515"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"182"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"A person's beauty comes through even more through their flaws.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An associate professor at New Sieg Academia with top-of-the-class skills as a surgeon. He's well-versed in psychology and sometimes acts as a consultant for the New Sieg police force. Sauli is Helvetica's guardian and cherishes him as though he were his real son."}],"source":"vndb"